      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SPEEDY CRUELLA (5) has mixed form recently, finishing fourth (22.64) in a Grade 5 at Cannington latest but did run well two back when in the frame. This looks easier and expected to bounce back. SUNSET CLAUDIUS (3) overcame a check in the run and hit the line hard to place (22.71) at this track over 400m in a Grade 5/6. Can measure up. ASTON CREMA (1) had been in super honest form hitting the frame two times on end before finishing fourth (23.12) at this track last time. Solid record here at the distance winning four races. Form from her last run is proving strong. One of the better hopes. MYSTIC PIXEL (2) is last start winner who looks one of the chances.",
